hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"89","[AI-translation] Hazrat Talhah bin Ubaidullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Aap ke mimbar par farmate hue suna: 'Khabardar aye logon, Allah us imam [hukmaran] ki namaz qubool nahin farmata jo us ke baghair faisla kare jo Allah Taala ne nazil farmaya. Aur Allah taharat ke baghair namaz qubool nahin farmata, aur na ghulool [chhupaye hue maal ghanimat] se sadqa [qubool farmata hai].'"
"90","[AI-translation] Hazrat Talhah bin Ubaidullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko mimbar par farmate hue suna: 'Khabardar aye logon, apne Rabb ki taraf tauba karo is se pehle ke tum maro. Aur nek aamal mein jaldi karo is se pehle ke tum mashghool ho jao. Aur jo tumhare aur tumhare Rabb Azza wa Jalla ke darmiyan hai use Usi ke kasrat se zikr se, aur chhup kar aur khul kar kasrat se sadqe se jodo; zuhd ikhtiyar karo, sawab pao, aur madad diye jao. Aur jano ke Allah Taala ne tum par juma farz kiya hai mere is khade hone ki jagah mein, mere is din mein, mere is mahine mein, mere is saal se lekar qayamat ke din tak. Phir jo use meri zindagi mein ya meri maut ke baad chhode, jabke us ka imam ho, to Allah us ki bikhri hui [halat] ko jama na farmaye; khabardar, Allah us ke muamle mein use barkat na de; khabardar, us ke liye koi neki nahin; khabardar, us ke liye koi roza nahin; khabardar, us ke liye koi namaz nahin; khabardar, koi aurat kisi mard ki imamat na kare, koi dehati kisi muhajir ki imamat na kare, khabardar, koi fajir [nafarman] kisi momin ki imamat na kare, siwae is ke ke use badshah majboor kare jis ki talwar aur kode se wo darta ho.'"
